    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="integrating-websocketgateway-with-microservices-in-nestjs">Integrating WebSocketGateway with Microservices in NestJS</h1>
<h2 id="motivation">Motivation</h2>
<p>Using <code>WebsocketGateway</code> as a gateway: after receiving the client&rsquo;s long-lived connection, forward the message to the <code>microservice</code> through the <code>RabbitMQ</code> message queue for further processing. After the <code>microservice</code> finishes processing, it also sends the result to <code>RabbitMQ</code>; when <code>WebsocketGateway</code> receives the message, it sends it back to the client.</p>
